{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"六合彩金多寶頭獎「加碼」至7300萬元\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MARK-SIX-261124-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】今晚攪珠的六合彩金多寶，馬會首次試行「集氣加碼制」，頭獎加碼至7300萬元。</p><p>在中環士丹利街投注站，排隊投注的人龍延伸到街上。</p><p>馬會根據截至周一下午2時，今期六合彩累積投注額介乎6000萬至7000萬元，金多寶提升至5500萬元，令頭獎「加碼」可達7300萬元。</p><p>馬會早前稱，會視乎市民及各界反應再決定日後會否推出，或將「加碼」機制恆常化。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.774305+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:16:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:37:39.115518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:26.529793+00:00","content_hash":"1cf408e5ea40b65d0363e642314720cbad522937f33961bb701868eed60add47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.774305+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}